{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "API Reference"}], "prev": {"link": "../", "title": "API Reference"}, "next": {"link": "act/", "title": "auth0_api_python.act"}, "title": "auth0_api_python", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth0_api_python\">\n<span id=\"auth0-api-python\"></span><h1>auth0_api_python<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth0_api_python\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>auth0-api-python</p>\n<p>A lightweight Python SDK for verifying Auth0-issued access tokens\nin server-side APIs, using Authlib for OIDC discovery and JWKS fetching.</p>\n<section id=\"submodules\">\n<h2>Submodules<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#submodules\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<div class=\"toctree-wrapper compound\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"act/\">auth0_api_python.act</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"api_client/\">auth0_api_python.api_client</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"cache/\">auth0_api_python.cache</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"config/\">auth0_api_python.config</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"encryption/\">auth0_api_python.encryption</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"errors/\">auth0_api_python.errors</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"token_store/\">auth0_api_python.token_store</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"token_utils/\">auth0_api_python.token_utils</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"types/\">auth0_api_python.types</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"utils/\">auth0_api_python.utils</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["autoapi/auth0_api_python/act/index", "auth0_api_python.act", "N", "next"], ["autoapi/index", "API Reference", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "autoapi/auth0_api_python/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">auth0_api_python</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#submodules\">Submodules</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "autoapi/auth0_api_python/index", "sidebars": ["about.html", "searchfield.html", "navigation.html", "relations.html", "donate.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0]}